@startuml
!pragma layout elk
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam margin 10
left to right direction

[*] --> Unresolved
Unresolved --> TeamKnown : stable team evidence
TeamKnown --> Candidate : jersey or ReID vote
Candidate --> Confirmed : vote threshold
Candidate --> TeamKnown : vote expires
Confirmed --> Ambiguous : evidence conflicts
Ambiguous --> Confirmed : analyst resolves
Ambiguous --> TeamKnown : identity removed
Confirmed --> Lost : track missing
Lost --> Confirmed : short recovery
Lost --> Unresolved : recovery expires
Confirmed --> [*] : session closes
@enduml
